  "title": "I Created a Full Dashboard in 3 Minutes Using Claude AI (No Code)",
  "description": "\ud83c\udf93 330,000+ learners have learned with us start your journey today. https://pavanlalwani.com/\n\nHello everyone and welcome to this interesting video! \n\nYou've created many dashboards, but this video shows how to create a dashboard using a cloud-based AI tool with a single prompt, eliminating the need for coding knowledge. \n\nThis process makes data visualization clean, simple, and easy, showcasing the power of dashboard automation and AI visual tools. See how to build dashboard with ai and get impressive outputs instantly!\n\nIn this step-by-step tutorial, you'll learn how to:\n\u2705 Upload your dataset directly into Claude AI (free version)\n\u2705 Use Claude AI to generate its own optimized prompt a game-changer!\n\u2705 Create an interactive dashboard with 10+ charts, slicers & filters as an HTML report\n\u2705 Refine and modify the dashboard using simple follow-up prompts\ud83d\udcca This works with any dataset.\n\n I use Superstore Data (Sales, Profit & Customer Info) and build a dashboard fit for a CEO or CFO presentation.\n\nPrompt + Data: https://drive.google.com/drive/folder... \n\n\u23f1\ufe0f Timestamps\n0:00 - Introduction\n0:09 - Can Claude AI build a dashboard without coding?\n0:30 - Using the Free version of Claude AI\n0:37 - Uploading your dataset into Claude AI\n0:54 - Why your prompt matters (most people get this wrong)\n0:59 - Trick: Ask Claude AI to write its OWN prompt\n1:15 - Crafting the perfect prompt (expert technique)\n1:34 - Setting dashboard requirements (CEO/CFO level)\n2:23 - Claude generates the optimized prompt\n2:37 - Feeding the prompt back into a new chat\n2:54 - Dashboard creation begins (takes 3-5 mins)\n3:08 - Dashboard is ready! \ud83c\udf89\n3:25 - Opening the interactive HTML dashboard\n3:32 - Exploring: Revenue, Profit, Orders, Customers & more\n3:50 - 10+ visuals, slicers & filters \u2014 all interactive\n3:57 - How to modify the dashboard with a simple prompt\n4:10 - Conclusion & next steps\n\n\ud83d\udd14 Subscribe for more AI Tools & Data Analytics tutorials every week!\n\ud83d\udc4d Like this video if it saved you hours of manual work!\n\ud83d\udccc Comment below: What dataset will YOU build a dashboard for?\n\n\ud83d\udd17Recommended Playlists:\n\u25b6 Power BI Tutorials \u2014\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u2022\u00a01.1\u00a0Power\u00a0BI\u00a0Tutorial\u00a0for\u00a0Beginners\u00a0(Intro...\u00a0\u00a0 \n\u25b6 AI Tools for Professionals \u2014 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u2022\u00a05\u00a0Simple\u00a0AI\u00a0Hacks\u00a0to\u00a0Generate\u00a0\u20b925,000/Mont...\u00a0\u00a0\n\u25b6 DAX Challenges \u2014 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u2022\u00a0I\u00a0Tried\u00a021\u00a0Days\u00a0of\u00a0DAX\u00a0Consistency\u00a0and\u00a0Her...\u00a0\u00a0 \n\nFull course with certificate: https://pavanlalwani.com\nFor corporate training: support@pavanlalwani.com\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nScandinavianz  \u00a0\u00a0/\u00a0scandinavianz\u00a0\u00a0\nCreative Commons \u2014 Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported \u2014 CC BY-SA 3.0\nFree Download / Stream: https://hypeddit.com/track/kqanzh\nMusic promoted by:\nGood Vibes - No Copyright Vlog Music https://bit.ly/2YAg2XI\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n#ClaudeAI #NoDashboard #AIDashboard #DataAnalytics #AITools2026 #NoCoding #DataVisualization #ClaudeAITutorial",
